{
    "title": "Bebs: make the date real",
    "description": "Bebs makes dates real for a reason... Why?\r\n\r\nReal Gifts: Who doesn't love tokens of appreciation? With the feature of sending real gifts, making someone you like happy has become even easier. Simply choose a gift from our partners' catalog, and it will be delivered straight to the recipient. Whether it's a bouquet of flowers or a new car, gifts are available to suit every taste.\r\n\r\nDinners: Making the first move is now even easier. With the dinner invitation feature, resisting is practically impossible. Invite someone you like by choosing from a list of restaurants. Spend time over a pleasant dinner with pleasant people.\r\nInnovative \r\n\r\nBebs Cards: Meet people in a refreshingly new way! Our unique Bebs Cards, with their individual QR codes, are your ticket to authentic interactions. Hand one to someone you find interesting, and they can instantly connect with you in the app. It's real-world meets digital - making every encounter more exciting!\r\n\r\nFunctional Chats: In addition to text messages, our chats allow you to send audio and video messages. You can also react to and quote messages. Attach photo and video files, invite someone to dinner, and send real and virtual gifts directly in the chat. Dating app chats have never been this engaging.\r\n\r\nMeaningful Matches: Unlike some apps that hinder your search for the right match, our intelligent algorithm empowers you to choose freely. If you find your match in just one day and decide to delete our app, we'll be happy knowing that Bebs served its purpose.\r\n\r\nTwo Feeds: One main feed and a feed with users meeting in real life through Bebs Cards. Enjoy a unique experience by switching between the two different feeds. Link Bebs Cards to your profile by ordering your set on Amazon and appear in the Card Holders feed.\r\n\r\nConscious Verification: Verify your profile only when you want to. All users who choose to verify their profiles undergo a manual document review. This means that a profile with a checkmark is part of our conscientious community, making meeting such users in real life even safer.\r\n\r\n\u0421onvenient feed: Scroll up and down just like in popular social networks. No more swiping right or left, and no paid reverts. Scrolling the feed in Bebs is convenient, and you can revisit users you liked until the feed refreshes. Give likes to those you fancy\u2014no dislikes needed in our friendly community.\r\n\r\nAnimated Sticker Packs: Over 70 animated stickers for easy communication. Expressing emotions has never been simpler!\r\n\r\nPrivacy & Safety First: We're committed to keeping your chats secure and your identity private. Enjoy open conversations in a safe, protected environment. Chat histories, including photo and video attachments, are stored on your device after they're uploaded and are deleted from our servers.\r\n\r\nPremier Subscription: Discover the benefits of Bebs Premier today starting at just $5 a month. Wow, that's cheaper than a cup of cappuccino!\r\n* Message anyone without a match\r\n* Unlimited likes\r\n* Advanced filter and privacy settings\r\n* See who liked you\r\n* Request profile verification\r\n* Traveler mode\r\n* And many other features await you in our premium subscription, Bebs Premier.\r\n\r\nCommunity of Authentic Individuals: Bebs is more than an app; it's a thriving community. Join a network of people seeking genuine relationships and experiences.  Be part of a movement that values real connections.\r\n\r\nUser-Friendly Experience: With an intuitive interface, Bebs is designed for ease of use. We keep it simple, so you can focus on creating meaningful connections.\r\n\r\nReady for a new chapter in your social life? Download Bebs now and step into a world where connections are real, conversations matter, and every encounter holds the promise of something special.\r\n\r\nFor illustrative purposes, model photos are used.\r\n\r\nhttps://bebs.app/policy?policy=Terms+of+Service \r\nhttps://bebs.app/policy?policy=Privacy+Policy\r\nhttps://bebs.app/company/zero_tolerance",
